          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shelf costs nothing when idle: switching it off hides the tab and refuses drops, it does not save battery. Lowering its limits moves the files that no longer fit to the Trash straight away. Clipboard history is the only repeating timer in the app, and switching it off stops it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The shelf costs nothing when idle: switching it off hides the tab and refuses drops, it does not save battery. Lowering its limits moves the files that no longer fit to the Trash straight away. Clipboard history is the only repeating timer in the app, and switching it off stops it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
