    "Which display the notch lives on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Which display the notch lives on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With None, a timer that finishes while the panel is open shows no peek and makes no sound." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With None, a timer that finishes while the panel is open shows no peek and makes no sound."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With more than one display, following the focused window moves the notch to whichever display you are working on. Built-in keeps it on the laptop screen, and uses the main display when the lid is closed. A named display keeps it there; while that display is unplugged the notch waits on the built-in display and returns when it is connected again. Larger text makes the open panel larger to fit it; the closed notch and its glances stay their size, fitted to the camera housing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With more than one display, following the focused window moves the notch to whichever display you are working on. Built-in keeps it on the laptop screen, and uses the main display when the lid is closed. A named display keeps it there; while that display is unplugged the notch waits on the built-in display and returns when it is connected again. Larger text makes the open panel larger to fit it; the closed notch and its glances stay their size, fitted to the camera housing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
